WEBVTT

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.850
Six years ago... Six years ago...

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.480
Six years ago, eh? Get a hold of yourself!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.030
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.920
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.060
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.830
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:37.800
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.940
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.810
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.780
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.950
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.890
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:25.590
I Found Love - And, Repeat From Beginning.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.840
Thanks, oniichan.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.850
Say... We can meet again, can't we?

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:48.180
Huh? Y... Yeah...

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.750
Promise me!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:05.390
Yeah! I promise! In six years... right here!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.710
A...Ayukawa!

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.940
Kasuga...

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:35.750
Would you be quiet?! Boys shouldn't cry forever just because they fell!

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.330
Gosh!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.830
Yippedee... C'mon... Please stop crying.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.820
C'mon! Here!

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.220
Be careful going home, okay?

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:00.190
Yeah.
Be careful going home, okay?

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.160
Bye-bye!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.360
A...yukawa...

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:20.220
Kasuga... what are you doing here?!

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.330
Huh?! Wh... Wh...
What about you, Ayukawa?!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.820
I was...

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.560
...looking for you, Kasuga...

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.660
...and then...

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.200
...and then, your Grandpa said...

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.760
My Grandpa?!

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.300
Grandpa brought you here?!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:41.990
Now I get it! So he sent me here... It was all Grandpa's doing!

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.390
Madoka's Big Sister!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.440
Hello!

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.610
Hikaru...?!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.720
Kasuga! What's going on here?!

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.720
Huh?! Well... er...

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.200
Where on Earth did Darling go?!

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:22.210
On top of that, even Madoka isn't home!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.310
Right... And she's leaving tomorrow, you know!

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.850
At the very least, I was...

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.820
...hoping that we could all have one last dinner with her at ABCB.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.140
I wonder if she's finished all her packing?

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.990
Hikaru...

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:38.260
It's gotten dark, so let's go home.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.830
What're you talking about?!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:43.050
It's not like we won't be able to go home just 'cuz it's dark!

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.260
Elopement?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.890
Maybe those two have eloped!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:52.570
What?!

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.530
What?!
What?!

00:05:56.100 --> 00:06:01.300
Kazuya... what do you mean... by that...?

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:04.690
You know... that indecisive oniichan might've...

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:07.710
...eloped with Madoka-neechan...

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.530
Gosh! Kids this age sure do love to show off new words! Right?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.570
Yup! Yup!

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:17.620
Right...!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.660
Howdy!

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:24.150
Kurumi! Manami!
Howdy!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:28.740
Say, say... Is it true that Kasuga and Ayukawa have vanished?!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.800
They've eloped, right?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.940
Gee!

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:35.100
Wh...?
Gee!

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.140
WhWhWhat the?!
Wh...?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:45.790
Miss?

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:47.650
Yes?
Miss?

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.090
You... dropped your handkerchief.
Yes?

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:49.220
You... dropped your handkerchief.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.690
Oh!
You... dropped your handkerchief.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:50.770
You... dropped your handkerchief.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.340
Er... May I ask your name?

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:54.930
I'm "Umao." And you are...?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.620
Yes... I'm "Ushiko."
I'm "Umao." And you are...?

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.010
I see!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.410
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.600
Umao! And, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:08.340
What?!

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:15.300
Yes... this is our world,
six years into the past.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.600
It's all clear now, isn't it?

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:25.970
That I'm...

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:28.650
...a being with paranormal powers!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.940
Ayukawa...

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:33.970
...I'm sorry... for not having told you sooner!

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.080
Wonderful. That's wonderful!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:51.250
I... was supposed to be leaving for America...

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:57.050
Because Dad is ill...
But, there's no need for that now.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.570
"A girl who vanished...

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:01.430
"...chasing a man with
paranormal powers into the past."

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:02.800
Well! That's wonderful!

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.840
Ayukawa! What are you talking about?!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.660
What I've told you is all true!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.410
What's wrong with that...?

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.550
That the man...

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.180
...I fell for...

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:20.510
...just happens to have paranormal powers?

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.850
Ayukawa...

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.500
Ayukawa...

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.510
Ayukawa...

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.560
Kasuga... This is weird...

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.590
I'm a normal person, and I'm not crying!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.500
Yeah... You're right!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.940
Oh... Are you hungry?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.770
Yeah... Now that you mention it.

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:15.970
I'll go get us something to eat!
Wait here, okay?

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.040
Yeah.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.310
H...Hikaru...

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:57.340
You butthole!
Who do you think you are?!

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:01.860
You bastard! How dare you just pop in here!

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:03.610
Y...Yuusaku!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.370
Whatcha tryin' to do, man?!

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.170
Say... who is this guy?

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.470
Darling, he laid his hands on me!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.500
Dammit... He's dead meat!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.340
Teleport!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.220
What the?!

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:48.530
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:55.500
Popping out of nowhere... You're busted for interfering with our official duties!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.500
K...Komatsu and Hatta...

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.940
No "Mr." or anything? You don't know me!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.780
Y...Y...You're putting me on, right?
Right? Right?

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:15.570
Hold it! Hold it!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.050
Hold it, you son-of-a-bitch!

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.000
"Kasuga Takashi, Manami & Kurumi"

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:40.950
Dunkin'...

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.220
Gee, Kurumi! Didn't you lock the door?!

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:58.900
What in the world is going on around here?!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.810
Manami... Kurumi...

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:04.870
PERVERT!
PERVERT!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.530
Nobody...

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:25.560
Nobody seems to have ever heard of me!

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.840
A parallel world!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:40.870
I must've moved to a parallel world
in which I don't exist!

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.920
Oh, no... Ayukawa...

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.890
I've left her behind, six years in the past!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:49.780
Grandpa warned me once, now that I remember...

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:54.260
"That's right! Should their past and present selves come into contact...

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:58.260
"...normal human beings will completely vanish from the time-line!"

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:04.360
If Ayukawa... If she ever runs into her self from six years ago...

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.380
Ayukawa!

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.540
Who are you shoutin' at?

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.890
You're not a familiar face
from around here.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:27.730
For bothering me... you don't seem like that much of a guy to begin with.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.830
Huh?! W... Er... I was, er...

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.060
Wrong person, you say? Then beat it!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.060
But...

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.390
Guys! I see him! Over here!
But...

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.650
Hold it, you!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:40.670
Inside!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:41.130
What?!
Inside!

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:48.000
A kid... came in here just now, didn't he?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.620
Ran out from the back.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.270
Lying to us won't help you!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:58.090
Well... you've been
behaving yourself recently, so...

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.120
T...Take it easy, you hear?

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.870
I'm saved! But why did you cover for me?

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:10.930
I hate cops, y'know...

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.310
What the...

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.270
Go out the back way... and get lost!

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.190
At the time...

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:32.310
...I had no idea at all as to what...

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.520
Say...

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:49.400
Y... You're...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.050
...was happening six years ago...

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.600
Ayukawa Madoka...

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:23.280
You're gonna be answering me today for sure!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.780
Give up, why don't ya?!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:14.750
Fine.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.160
Ayukawa...

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:22.760
Come hang out with us... Ayukawa Madoka!

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:31.700
Myself... from six years ago?

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:38.410
A-ha... You look just like my sister!

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:42.550
Say... about that oniichan from before...

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.220
He your boyfriend?

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.120
What?!
He your boyfriend?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:13.460
Impressive... Ayukawa Madoka, top bitch of Koryo School.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:17.720
No wonder you never
surrendered to me all this time.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:26.250
Well? Do you finally feel up to giving in a little?

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:37.280
Guys... You can have your way with her.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:42.250
Sure! I have to wonder...
if I deserve to enjoy such a beauty!

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:46.260
Say... What made you think that I was his girlfriend?

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:48.430
'Cause... that oniichan was saying...

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:52.250
...he likes sexy girls with long hair.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:58.870
Say... I bet you must like that oniichan too!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.460
Yeah. I love him!

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:06.270
I'll... be his bride!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:10.140
I wish you the best.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:14.150
Let's shake hands!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:22.990
Let's get to know each other...

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.620
...all night long!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:44.610
Stop!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:50.990
I heard Ayukawa's voice...

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:53.520
But I don't have telepathic powers!

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.300
Ayukawa...

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.330
Ayukawa!

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:10.540
What... was that voice?!

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:15.160
I... just heard Kasuga's voice now...

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:17.280
Madoka?

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.400
We're going home.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.880
Sis...?!

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:26.310
See ya!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.030
Ayukawa!

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.340
What the...?!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.940
Ayukawa! Are you all right?!

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:09.100
Say, Grandpa...

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:14.120
Where did Kyosuke-niichan and Madoka-oneechan go anyway?!

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:18.900
Say, Kazuya... would you go pick them up soon?

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.710
I'm glad that I met you.

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:34.230
From now on, I'd better...
try to behave a bit for a change...

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:35.720
...for the sake of a certain someone.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.180
Ow...

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.210
Oh? Where am I?

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.010
Kasuga...

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:14.230
Are you... the Kasuga of six years ago?!

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:17.430
Kazuya!

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:18.660
Where's Oniichan?
Kazuya!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:19.960
Ayukawa!
Where's Oniichan?

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:26.960
Ayukawa! Thank goodness you're all right!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.270
"All right?!" What do you mean by that?

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.790
What the?! Kazuya...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.850
I'll leave you guys behind
if you don't want to go back!

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:40.390
Are you ready?

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:41.860
Kasuga...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:45.130
I'll... wait for you to come back from America, Ayukawa!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.890
I'll be right here waiting for you.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:54.370
Okeydokey...

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:59.370
Kyosuke-niichan...
when do you want to go back to?

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:06.430
And then I... pretend that I'm taking a nap again right here.

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:10.920
See? Before long, she comes...

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:12.950
...to tickle my nose...

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:20.630
And then, this is what she'll say...

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:23.490
You'll catch a cold if you take a nap there!

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:26.460
Told you so, didn't I?

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:29.670
You're napping away, and it's only noon!

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:32.400
That's why it's called a noontime nap!

00:22:33.570 --> 00:22:36.340
"That's why it's called a noontime nap?"

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:42.350
I remember someone
who said the same thing!

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.280
Oh? And, exactly who was that someone, if I may ask?

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:52.850
That someone was, well...

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:55.930
That someone was... my first love.

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:00.190
And...

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:02.980
And, Ayukawa, he still...

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:06.000
...treasures you for who you are.

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:35.780
I, Kasuga Kyosuke...

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:40.080
...with Ayukawa Madoka... had, for the second time...

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:44.100
...a "first kiss."

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:58.400
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:02.270
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:13.980
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:13.980 --> 00:24:19.750
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.750 --> 00:24:28.090
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.090 --> 00:24:35.630
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.630 --> 00:24:43.280
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.280 --> 00:24:50.920
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:50.920 --> 00:24:58.410
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)
